    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Types of home",
     "texto": [
      "**Dom** means «house» and **blok** a block of flats. To say where you live, we use **mieszkam w...**; **w bloku** means «in a block of flats»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Floors",
     "texto": [
      "**Na którym piętrze?** asks «on which floor?». **Na parterze** means «on the ground floor».",
      "**Małe** agrees with the neuter noun **mieszkanie**: **małe mieszkanie**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
